# JAIDE V23_5 Minimal Production System

This repository contains a minimal, production-oriented Zig implementation with:
- In-process PFR core (matvec, simple JIT, echo inference), no extern/NIF dependencies on the critical path. [1]
- Lightweight modules: QuantumIR, Antares-subgraph stub, QLiteNet, NeuroPulse SSM, all called directly from Zig. [1]

Prerequisites:
- Zig 0.12+ on PATH. [1]
- Optional: CUDA toolchain for gpu_microbench.cu (not required to build the Zig binary). [1]

Usage:
- make fmt [1]
- make test [1]
